January 26 -[ This coming] weekend,[ I]�[�m] meeting[ a] friend[ of] mine[ in a mutually] adjoining state for[ a] fun weekend of[ scrapbooking and] girl time! I�[�m horribly] behind on my[ scrap]booking and am determined to make the most of this opportunity.[ 250]+ pictures, 28[ layouts], 60[ pages], and countless pieces of[ paper] later, I am ready.
January 25 – Samuel and[ I] spent some time coloring[ trains this afternoon] ([his latest passion]).
January 24 – I found Kaelynn today reading to her baby[ doll].
